-7deaf7f6b2"},{"id":"langsci495-980fbb4911","tx":"Abdi ngaleueut kopi teu sareng gula.","sg":["Abdi","nga-leueut","kopi","teu","sareng","gula."],"gl":["1SG","ACT-drink","coffee","NEG","COM","sugar"],"tl":"I drink coffee without sugar.","anchor":"langsci495-980fbb4911"},{"id":"langsci495-404af0f1ce","tx":"Abdi maehan rusa teu sareng amang abdi.","sg":["Abdi","maehan","rusa","teu","sareng","amang","abdi."],"gl":["1SG","hunt","deer","NEG","COM","uncle","1SG"],"tl":"I hunt deer without my uncle.","anchor":"langsci495-404af0f1ce"},{"id":"langsci495-5ff3941449","tx":"Abdi bakal nyeri haté pisan lamun hirup teu sareng pun bapak.","sg":["Abdi","bakal","nyeri","haté","pisan","lamun","hirup","teu","sareng","pun","bapak."],"gl":["1SG","FUT","sick","liver","very","if","live","NEG","COM","HON","father"],"tl":"I would be so very sick to my heart if I had to live without my father.","anchor":"langsci495-5ff3941449"},{"id":"langsci495-3165567f96","tx":"Barudak sadayana ningali abdi téh meni teu leupasleupas.","sg":["Barudak","sadayana","ningali","abdi","téh","meni","teu","leupas-leupas."],"gl":["child.PL","all","ACT.look","1SG","DP","very","NEG","release-RED"],"tl":"All the children looked at me ceaselessly.","anchor":"langsci495-3165567f96"},{"id":"langsci495-cb52c0a123","tx":"Manéhna gawé euweuh kacapé ngajelang acara pernikahan.","sg":["Manéhna","gawé","euweuh","ka-capé","nga-jelang","acara","pernikahan."],"gl":["3SG","work","NEG.EX","NMLZ-tired","ACT-approach","event","wedding"],"tl":"She worked tirelessly leading up to the wedding.","anchor":"langsci495-cb52c0a123"},{"id":"langsci495-acf5d139bd","tx":"Pun bapak teu aya kacapé ngadamel karanjang siang wengi.","sg":["Pun","bapak","teu","aya","ka-capé","nga-damel","karanjang","siang","wengi."],"gl":["HON","father","NEG","EX","NMLZ-tired","ACT-work","basket","day","night"],"tl":"My dad doesn’t feel tired making a basket all day.","anchor":"langsci495-acf5d139bd"},{"id":"langsci495-2108bbd221","tx":"Lami teu aya nanaon urang tiasa 